  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/harvest-with-ease/banner.gif\" alt=\"輕鬆收割橫幅\"></p><hr><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/minecraft/minecraft.svg\" alt=\"Minecraft\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/harvest-with-ease/files?version=26.1&amp;g=26.1.2\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/minecraft/26-1-x.svg\" alt=\"26.1.x\"></a><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/separator.svg\" alt=\"分隔符\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/harvest-with-ease/files?version=1.21.11\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/minecraft/1-21-11.svg\" alt=\"1.21.11\"></a><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/separator.svg\" alt=\"分隔符\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/harvest-with-ease/files?version=1.21.10\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/minecraft/1-21-10.svg\" alt=\"1.21.10\"></a><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/separator.svg\" alt=\"分隔符\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/harvest-with-ease/files?version=1.21.8\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/minecraft/1-21-8.svg\" alt=\"1.21.8\"></a><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/separator.svg\" alt=\"分隔符\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/harvest-with-ease/files?version=1.21.7\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/minecraft/1-21-7.svg\" alt=\"1.21.7\"></a><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/separator.svg\" alt=\"分隔符\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/harvest-with-ease/files?version=1.21.6\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/minecraft/1-21-6.svg\" alt=\"1.21.6\"></a><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/separator.svg\" alt=\"分隔符\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/harvest-with-ease/files?version=1.21.5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/minecraft/1-21-5.svg\" alt=\"1.21.5\"></a><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/separator.svg\" alt=\"分隔符\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/harvest-with-ease/files?version=1.21.4\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/minecraft/1-21-4.svg\" alt=\"1.21.4\"></a><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/separator.svg\" alt=\"分隔符\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/harvest-with-ease/files?version=1.21.3\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/minecraft/1-21-3.svg\" alt=\"1.21.3\"></a><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/separator.svg\" alt=\"分隔符\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/harvest-with-ease/files?version=1.21.1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/minecraft/1-21-1.svg\" alt=\"1.21.1\"></a><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/separator.svg\" alt=\"分隔符\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/harvest-with-ease/files?version=1.21\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/minecraft/1-21.svg\" alt=\"1.21\"></a><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/separator.svg\" alt=\"分隔符\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/harvest-with-ease/files?version=1.20.4\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/minecraft/1-20-4.svg\" alt=\"1.20.4\"></a><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/separator.svg\" alt=\"分隔符\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/harvest-with-ease/files?version=1.20.2\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/minecraft/1-20-2.svg\" alt=\"1.20.2\"></a><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/separator.svg\" alt=\"分隔符\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/harvest-with-ease/files?version=1.20.1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/minecraft/1-20-1.svg\" alt=\"1.20.1\"></a><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/separator.svg\" alt=\"分隔符\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/harvest-with-ease/files?version=1.19.4\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/minecraft/1-19-4.svg\" alt=\"1.19.4\"></a><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/separator.svg\" alt=\"分隔符\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/harvest-with-ease/files?version=1.19.2\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/minecraft/1-19-2.svg\" alt=\"1.19.2\"></a></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/loader/loader.svg\" alt=\"載入器\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/harvest-with-ease/files?gameVersionTypeId=6\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/loader/neoforge.svg\" alt=\"NeoForge\"></a><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/separator.svg\" alt=\"分隔符\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/harvest-with-ease/files?gameVersionTypeId=4\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/loader/fabric.svg\" alt=\"Fabric\"></a></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/side/server.svg\" alt=\"覆蓋層\"></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/github/issues.svg\" alt=\"問題回報\"><a href=\"https://github.com/crystal-nest/harvest-with-ease/issues\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/github/github.svg\" alt=\"GitHub\"></a></p><hr><h2>📝 <strong>描述</strong></h2><p>厭倦了反覆破壞並重新種植作物嗎？<br>\n<strong>輕鬆收割（Harvest With Ease）</strong> 讓您可以 <strong>對著完全成熟的作物按右鍵</strong> 來 <strong>立即收割並重新種植</strong> — 不再需要繁瑣的重新種植！</p><p>它開箱即用，支援 <strong>原版作物</strong> 和 <strong>大多數模組作物</strong>，讓您輕鬆享受農耕樂趣。</p><blockquote>\n  <p>💡 <em>注意：雖然這個模組技術上僅需伺服器端安裝，但未安裝模組的客戶端在手持方塊收割時可能會出現視覺故障（方塊閃爍）。若要避免此問題，請在設定中將 <code>require hoe</code> 設為 <code>true</code>。</em></p>\n</blockquote><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fminecraftstorage.com%252fmods%252fharvest-with-ease%253fref%253dcrystal-nest\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/harvest-with-ease/minecraft-storage-banner.png\" alt=\"Minecraft Storage\"></a></p><h2>✨ <strong>特色</strong></h2><ul>\n<li>✅ <strong>右鍵收割並重新種植</strong> – 支援 <strong>原版</strong> 和大多數 <strong>模組作物</strong>！<br>\n<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/harvest-with-ease/wheat.gif\" alt=\"收割小麥\"></li>\n<li>🍫 也支援 <strong>地獄疙瘩</strong> 和 <strong>可可豆</strong>！<br>\n<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/harvest-with-ease/cocoa.gif\" alt=\"收割可可豆\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/harvest-with-ease/wart.gif\" alt=\"收割地獄疙瘩\"></li>\n<li>🌱 自動消耗 1 個作物來模擬重新種植。</li>\n<li>✨ <strong>幸運附魔支援</strong> – 使用帶有幸運附魔的物品可獲得額外掉落物！</li>\n<li>⚙️ <strong>高度可設定</strong> – 可根據您的遊玩風格調整（請參閱下方說明）。</li>\n</ul><h2>⚙️ <strong>設定</strong></h2><p>透過以下設定自訂您的農耕體驗：</p><ul>\n<li>與模組作物的相容性。</li>\n<li>遊戲平衡，例如是否需要工具或限制多次收割。</li>\n<li>調整多方塊收割行為。</li>\n</ul><p>📖 請參閱 <a href=\"https://github.com/Crystal-Nest/harvest-with-ease/wiki/End-user-configuration\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">專屬 Wiki 頁面</a> 以了解完整詳情！</p><h2>🔗 <strong>依賴項目</strong></h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"text-align:left\">模組</th>\n<th style=\"text-align:center\">載入器</th>\n<th style=\"text-align:center\">需求</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cobweb\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Cobweb</a></td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\">全部</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\">必要</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/forge-config-api-port\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Forge Config API Port</a></td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\">Fabric；Forge ≥ 1.20.2</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\">必要</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table><h2>📜 <strong>授權與使用權</strong></h2><p>歡迎在任何模組包或影片中使用此模組，只需註明出處並可能連結到<a href=\"https://github.com/crystal-nest/harvest-with-ease#readme\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">此處</a>即可。<br>\n此專案採用 <a href=\"https://github.com/crystal-nest/harvest-with-ease/blob/master/LICENSE\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Crystal Nest Community License v1</a> 發佈。</p><h2>💻 <strong>給開發者</strong></h2><p>預設情況下，任何繼承自 <code>CropBlock</code> 的作物都會自動與此模組相容 — 無需額外步驟！<br>\n如果您的作物 <strong>沒有繼承 <code>CropBlock</code></strong>，您仍可透過 <code>crops</code> 設定選項來支援它們。只要確保：</p><ul>\n<li>方塊具有名為 <code>\"age\"</code> 的整數屬性。</li>\n<li>該屬性代表從 <code>0</code> 到最大值的生長階段。</li>\n</ul><p>從 <strong>v9.0.0</strong> 開始，可以透過方塊標籤將作物加入黑名單。</p><p>📚 完整的整合指南可在 <a href=\"https://github.com/Crystal-Nest/harvest-with-ease/wiki\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Wiki</a> 上找到。</p><h2>❤️ <strong>支持我們</strong></h2><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fcrystalnest.it%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"Crystal Nest 網站\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/crystal-nest/pic512.png\" width=\"14.286%\"></a><a href=\"https://discord.gg/BP6EdBfAmt\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"Discord\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/discord/discord512.png\" width=\"14.286%\"></a><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/crystalspider\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"Patreon\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/patreon/patreon512.png\" width=\"14.286%\"></a><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fcrystalspider\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"Ko-fi\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/kofi/kofi512.png\" width=\"14.286%\"></a><a href=\"https://github.com/Crystal-Nest\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"我們的其他專案\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/github/github512.png\" width=\"14.286%\"></a><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252forganization%252fcrystal-nest\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"Modrinth\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/modrinth/modrinth512.png\" width=\"14.286%\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/crystalspider/projects\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"CurseForge\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/curseforge/curseforge512.png\" width=\"14.286%\"></a></p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fcrystalspider\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/partners/custom-banners/d559b544-474c-4109-b861-1b2e6ca6026a.webp\" alt=\"Bisect Hosting\"></a></p>",
